  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>Field gun platoons crew light ultra autocannons capable of firing at double the rate of standard weapons of the same caliber. The rapid-fire capability delivers sustained suppressive fire at long range, making these platoons effective at denying ground and pinning enemy formations. The ultra mechanism risks jamming under rapid fire, a known hazard that crews train to clear quickly but cannot entirely prevent in sustained engagements.</p>"
